msgstr ""

#: index.md:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Gebruik het kleinste pakket"

#: index.md:28
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Install just <code>@pantoken/css</code> for a stylesheet, <code>@pantoken/"
"pendo</code> for guides, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr ""
"Installeer alleen @pantoken/css voor een stylesheet, @pantoken/react voor "
"hooks en iconen, of een bundler-preset voor Tailwind, Panda of MUI."

#: index.md:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Genereer voor elk platform"

#: index.md:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Install the pantoken cli to generate presets or add components for any "
"platform&colon; web, native, and anything in between."
msgstr ""

#: index.md:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "No React needed"
msgstr ""

#: index.md:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The InstUI library is tightly coupled with React. If you want to use it, you "
"have to use React. Now you can build anywhere."
msgstr ""

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
#~ msgstr "InstUI, overal"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream "
#~ "and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Elk pakket leest dezelfde opgeloste token-IR. Verander een token upstream "
#~ "en het stroomt op dezelfde manier naar CSS, SCSS, native code en Figma."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, "
#~ "WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
